{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122319","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122319/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122319/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122319/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122319","id":5124565873,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc79u3mX","number":122319,"title":"Core: Add `WRITE_EXCLUSIVE` and `WRITE_READ_EXCLUSIVE` file modes","user":{"login":"dalexeev","id":47700418,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NzAwNDE4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47700418?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev","html_url":"https://github.com/dalexeev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","color":"aaccff","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097966,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc5NjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:core","name":"topic:core","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":1,"created_at":"2026-08-11T21:00:45Z","updated_at":"2026-10-09T08:14:58Z","closed_at":"2026-10-09T08:13:38Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/122319","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122319","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122319.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122319.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\n- Closes https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/3591.\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\nThis PR adds file modes with exclusive creation, which corresponds to the `x` flag:\r\n\r\n> File access mode flag \"x\" can optionally be appended to \"w\" or \"w+\" specifiers. This flag forces the function to fail if the file exists, instead of overwriting it.\r\n\r\n- [`open()`](https://docs.python.org/3/library/functions.html#open) in Python.\r\n- [`std::fopen()`](https://en.cppreference.com/cpp/io/c/fopen) in C++.\r\n- [`fopen()`](https://en.cppreference.com/c/io/fopen) in C.\r\n- [`fopen(3)`](https://www.man7.org/linux/man-pages/man3/fdopen.3.html#NOTES) in Linux man.\r\n\r\nI skipped Windows because it requires a more complex implementation and I couldn't test it. Godot uses `_wfsopen()`, which doesn't support the `x` flag. `_wfopen()` supports `x`, but as far as I understand, Windows opens the file in non-shared mode, which is unacceptable due to inconsistency with the behavior of UNIX platforms. Perhaps an alternative solution is to use a lower-level API (`CreateFileA()` + `_wfdopen()`?).\r\n\r\n- [`_wfsopen()`](https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/cpp/c-runtime-library/reference/fsopen-wfsopen?view=msvc-170)\r\n- [`_wfopen()`](https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/cpp/c-runtime-library/reference/fopen-wfopen?view=msvc-170)\r\n- [`CreateFileA()`](https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/windows/win32/api/FileAPI/nf-fileapi-createfilea#see-also)\r\n- [`_wfdopen()`](https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/cpp/c-runtime-library/reference/fdopen-wfdopen?view=msvc-170)","closed_by":{"login":"dalexeev","id":47700418,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NzAwNDE4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47700418?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev","html_url":"https://github.com/dalexeev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122319/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122319/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}